  <!-- D-018 FIX (2026-08-14): WITHOUT these two marker elements, `pac solution pack`
       silently drops every file under this entity's SavedQueries/ and FormXml/ folders —
       0 warnings, 0 errors, a solution that packs and imports "clean" and ships with no
       views and no forms. Confirmed by direct experiment: removing these two lines from an
       otherwise-identical Entity.xml took the packed <savedquery> count for this table from
       5 to 0 with no change anywhere else. Ground-truthed against a real DEV export, which
       carries the same two empty self-closing elements on every entity (see
       docs/development/revitalise-grant-automation-dev-deployment-handover.md §6 and
       Dev Summary revision 1.0, D-018). scripts/verify-forms-and-views-reachable.py gates
       this at build time so the omission cannot recur silently. -->
